NM0 (net135 IBIAS2 VSS VSS) mn18 w=1.938e-05 l=1.945e-06 m=30 //// *Load* *gm1* ``NM1``
R11 (net031 net125) resistor r=1.0 m=1 //// *R_z*
R9 (net055 net046) resistor r=12600.0 m=1 //// *R_a* ``R8``
