PM7 (VOUT net052 VDD VDD) mp18 w=1.951e-05 l=1.905e-06 m=29 //// *Load* *gm3*
PM6 (net053 net050 VDD VDD) mp18 w=1.517e-05 l=1.455e-06 m=4 //// *Load* *gm2*
PM5 (net031 net052 VDD VDD) mp18 w=1.531e-05 l=1.09e-06 m=3 //// *Input* *gm2*
